  "description": "Package updates are available for Amazon Linux 2 that fix the following vulnerabilities:\nCVE-2026-116124:\n\tA flaw was found in libgsf. A heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability exists in the OLE2 document parser within the ole_info_read_metabat function. A remote attacker could exploit this flaw by enticing a user to open a specially crafted file. Successful exploitation could lead to arbitrary code execution or cause an application crash, resulting in a Denial of Service (DoS).\n",
